      "created_at": "2018-03-26T11:37:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I really liked what Max Landis did with Legacy: American Hero. Getting all those different art styles in each individual issue to demonstrate the different parts of his life and how Paul grows into the Legacy we know.</p><p><span>The first story done with his father as well as the last one with Paulina really made me smile. If for entirely different reasons.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>",
